    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Towards Global <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Generation</span>: A Benchmark for Corpus-Level Reasoning
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
