    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Metadata-Driven <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Generation</span> for Financial Question Answering
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Dadopoulos%2C+M">Michail Dadopoulos</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ladas%2C+A">Anestis Ladas</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Moschidis%2C+S">Stratos Moschidis</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Negkakis%2C+I">Ioannis Negkakis</a>
      
