        META-RAG: Meta-Analysis-Inspired Evidence-Re-Ranking Method for <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Generation</span> in Evidence-Based Medicine
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
