    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        QueryIPI: Query-agnostic Indirect <span class="search-hit mathjax">Prompt</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Injection</span> on Coding Agents
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
