        NeuroGenPoisoning: Neuron-Guided Attacks on <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Generation</span> of LLM via Genetic Optimization of External Knowledge
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
