        A Feasibility Study on Usability and Trust among Population Groups of a Medical Avatar Supported by Large Language Models with <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Generation</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
