    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Scaling Beyond Context: A Survey of Multimodal <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Generation</span> for Document Understanding
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Gao%2C+S">Sensen Gao</a>, 
      
