    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Beyond Correctness: Rewarding Faithful Reasoning in <span class="search-hit mathjax">Retrieval</span>-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Augmented</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Generation</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
